{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_3000_situation", "source_sha256": "519de482532a012772818ba344328d358b7f8e2afc305ed71d53e8d5f9d1b64d", "ja": "遊園地のレポート　本番直前", "zh": "游乐园报导　正式拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_3000_place", "source_sha256": "3049bd9429cb91d0cec7ee49a32c3e03ffd1aff5d93eb4f41f01b0ac001b4436", "ja": "遊園地", "zh": "游乐园", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_3001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "38eba75d9b06f737090ae0c8b42a2048bebfd5f223af973ce9e2921952e99e1d", "ja": "ちょっと、{$P$}！\n遊園地の実況って、絶叫マシンだったの！？", "zh": "等等，{$P$}！\n游乐园的实况报导，是介绍刺激的游乐设施吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_3002_p", "source_sha256": "a58d6838d9ddd9bb9a8995693ae749333238eccd0e7e62c4e479cf24ea710e98", "ja": "ああ、すごいだろ。この遊園地の目玉、\nギネス級の超速コースターだ。", "zh": "是啊，很厉害吧？这座游乐园的亮点，\n就是金氏世界纪录级的超高速云霄飞车。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_3003_p", "source_sha256": "75c02554cb1cb334c182c1b13a0c8a341f4d0bce142800af7e9412fa31785d3d", "ja": "今すごく話題になってるからな。\nこのレポで、歩も注目されること間違いなしだ！", "zh": "现在讨论度很高，\n步一定也会因为这份报导工作而受到瞩目的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_3004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ed7f7a08cb920c4baabfef2e7897fb2599ba8e0e7e1fd40f7c9e068543f98fe3", "ja": "いや、ムリムリムリ！　ほんっとムリ！\nアタシには、こんなの絶対ムリだって！！", "zh": "不、不行不行不行！真的不行！\n我真的不能搭这种的！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_3005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "12d0d8c9a863c86496c53fd64b9583e68f0c5019ded4ded60df9cd9696a6f9e8", "ja": "このコースター、高い所から落ちるやつじゃん！\nアタシ、高い所はニガテなんだってば～！", "zh": "这座云霄飞车不是会从高空落下的吗！\n我很怕高啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_3006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3b6f9c52d5faa1cc93d5ab0af3e393d14a1d79d8232a16ee7f3b8a174066de78", "ja": "{$P$}！　どうして仕事受ける前に、\nアタシに一言聞いてくれなかったんだよ～！？", "zh": "{$P$}！在接下工作之前，\n为什么不先问我一声呀～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_3007_p", "source_sha256": "5b17722dc57aa399278b324a15f072eb47649e1f40bce71b09f9211861eb1045", "ja": "すまない、歩。実は……。", "zh": "抱歉，步，其实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_3008", "source_sha256": "f1aa7a8eea679622fc3119bab6ac4d85482836028d6564f2e1a0382cc44ad5be", "ja": "知ってた……", "zh": "我早就知道了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_3009", "source_sha256": "ae3d8518ee3c17ca95fdbb2328a72bfbaaf903c3a8327d80a2364c267c2d86ef", "ja": "知らなかった……", "zh": "我不知道……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_3100_p", "source_sha256": "69d301a97a7a3f692da02efe38b38a0980aa406a670dcfd5ebb229fa96aeed49", "ja": "歩が苦手そうなのは知ってたんだが、スタッフさんは、\nまさに、そういうアイドルを探しててな……。", "zh": "我知道步不太敢坐，\n但工作人员正是要找这种偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_3101_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6da230f02a0e997c91aabfd0ceb2e749f0cc4b3a6d97c1c335ad2f9fbf91e16c", "ja": "{$P$}……。わかったよ。\nこうなったらアタシも覚悟、決めるよ。", "zh": "{$P$}……我知道了啦。\n既然如此，我也会做好觉悟的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_3102_034ayu", "source_sha256": "870fd44e84a5e7008a1ca76b46a5efe445d07febc619aa5e9c89db79ecae7291", "ja": "ホントは、怖いけど……いっそ、正面から\nぶつかってやる～っ！　ゴートゥーヘールッ！", "zh": "我其实真的很害怕……不过干脆\n就正面迎战吧～！Go to hell！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_3200_p", "source_sha256": "69d301a97a7a3f692da02efe38b38a0980aa406a670dcfd5ebb229fa96aeed49", "ja": "歩が苦手そうなのは知ってたんだが、スタッフさんは、\nまさに、そういうアイドルを探しててな……。", "zh": "我知道步不太敢坐，\n但工作人员正是要找这种偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_3201_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cb37d11d8413e2cdc6d0e2d3185607125de16079c8d2c888bbd4f8f9989fd261", "ja": "オーマイガー！　そんな、捨てられた子犬みたいな目で\n見るなよ！　わかった、やるよ！　も～っ！", "zh": "Oh My God！别用那种被抛弃的小狗般的眼神\n看我啦！我知道，我坐就是了！真是的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_3202_p", "source_sha256": "a42ab260696295d115c71575e8439d9f340e7847fe9a74bee8124f6604113ca9", "ja": "すまない……この埋め合わせは、絶対するから。", "zh": "抱歉……我一定会补偿你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_3203_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1d68903e1d2099e020be76a8f5b22cc3ddbc8ec1fd320ac6e862795ddc689047", "ja": "言ったな～？　その言葉、ちゃんと覚えててよね、　\n{$P$}！", "zh": "说好啰～？你可要记好自己说过的话喔，\n{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_3300_p", "source_sha256": "79bef0b07d5939839e35820d9ef9c51e568e901f68d9570086fb7a3165fae03b", "ja": "ごめん、知らなかったんだ。\n歩が絶叫系ニガテだったなんて、ちょっと意外で……。", "zh": "抱歉，我不知道。\n步竟然不敢坐刺激的游乐设施，有点意外……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_3301_034ayu", "source_sha256": "901330d38aa31bc1e840a7a0c41cd28e9988af305208713063f54493ac002b73", "ja": "だろうね。よく言われるよ……。\n……わかった、やるよ！", "zh": "也是啦，常有人这样说……\n……我知道了，我会坐的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_3302_034ayu", "source_sha256": "84a035c4b1e1b750eeb9c849c454cbe439bf228560e3cfd70fea468c2e59286a", "ja": "知らなかったんなら、しょうがないよな。\nこれも番組のためだ！　アタシも、腹をくくるよ！", "zh": "既然你不知道，那也不能怪你。\n这也是为了节目！我会做好准备的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_3303_034ayu", "source_sha256": "27ddc5b80c8a738cc7d5fa76449d02c6c4799e5908d71c57d3d000041c3482a4", "ja": "そ……そのかわり！　ちゃんとできたら、\n何かご褒美、くれよな！　……絶対だからなーっ！", "zh": "交……交换条件是！如果我表现得好，\n你要给我奖励喔！……一定要喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_3400_p", "source_sha256": "79bef0b07d5939839e35820d9ef9c51e568e901f68d9570086fb7a3165fae03b", "ja": "ごめん、知らなかったんだ。\n歩が絶叫系ニガテだったなんて、ちょっと意外で……。", "zh": "抱歉，我不知道。\n步竟然不敢坐刺激的游乐设施，有点意外……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_3401_034ayu", "source_sha256": "989903586ad7cbc73025fa9fdb3274bf71af2de1712cbe6d42b2c473d5e8c29a", "ja": "意外って、どういう意味だよー！\nまぁ、そりゃ……よく言われるけど。", "zh": "意外是什么意思啊──！\n唔，不过……确实常有人这样说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_3402_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f59006c402ba38174f814e87513588540abf518f657b769fa3761f25fb99b764", "ja": "あ～っ、わかった、やるよ！　やればいいんだろ！\n{$P$}、後で覚えてろよ～っ！", "zh": "啊～我知道了，我会坐的！我坐总行了吧！\n{$P$}，你走着瞧啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
